   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "C++11 standardized Boost.Thread's types nearly unchanged. What it did not take is specific and still missing 15 years later: composition, the upgrade lock, and per-thread attributes.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "C++11 standardized Boost.Thread's types nearly unchanged. What it did not take is specific and still missing 15 years later: composition, the upgrade lock, and per-thread attributes.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
  {
   "id": "t1197140439",
   "type": "text",
